{"ID":"20240118151227-7m7zlcp","Spec":"2","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"id":"20240118151227-7m7zlcp","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240118151227-7m7zlcp\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240118151227-qz115q1\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240122113320-5hc44ln\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:300,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240122113320-5hc44ln\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:301,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:301\u0026#125;","title":"125龟甲","type":"doc","updated":"20240130144307"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240118151227-qz115q1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240118151227-qz115q1","updated":"20240122113222"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【本经原文】味咸平，主漏下赤白，破症瘕疟痎，五痔阴蚀，湿痹四肢重弱，小儿囟不合。久服轻身不饥。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122113227-9l0ehnq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122113227-9l0ehnq"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【产地】处处有之，生池泽及海水中，其甲即龟甲，肉亦入药。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122113228-yda4dkd","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122113228-yda4dkd"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【性味】味甘咸，性平，无毒。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122113230-qk93xqu","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122113230-qk93xqu"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【主治】龟板为益阴滋血要药，主补心肾，益大肠，去瘀血，续筋骨，治久疟，劳复，血痹，湿痹，症瘕，产难，久痢久泻。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122113232-bb58x1n","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122113232-bb58x1n"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【别录】惊恚气，心腹痛不可久立，骨中寒热，伤寒劳复；或肌体寒热欲死，以作汤良，久服益气资智，烧灰治小儿头疮难燥，女子阴疮。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122113235-k5kyj3h","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122113235-k5kyj3h"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【甄权】烧灰治脱肛。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122113238-01oe1ox","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122113238-01oe1ox"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【弘景】壳主久嗽，断疟。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122113239-94y8j09","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122113239-94y8j09"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【肃炳】壳炙末酒服，主风脚弱。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122113240-yn0dcq4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122113240-yn0dcq4"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【日华】治血麻痹。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122113242-jk35lg5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122113242-jk35lg5"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【丹溪】下甲补阴，主阴血不足，去瘀血，止血痢，续筋骨，治劳倦四肢无力。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122113244-k6ggug3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122113244-k6ggug3"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【容川】龟之性伏，其精在板，能通任脉，任为离中之阴，以下交于督，合为既济之象，故龟板益阴滋心肾。与鹿茸是对子。以水配火，不使壮火食气，如此气纳矣。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122113246-sl3zhwq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122113246-sl3zhwq"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【用量】普通二至四钱。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122113248-3zt9v6q","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122113248-3zt9v6q"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【禁忌】妊娠及病人虚而无热者，均忌，凡使用时须研极细，否则留滞肠胃，能变症瘕，鳖甲亦然，合猪肉菰米瓜笕食损人。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122113257-2yeqs8h","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122113257-2yeqs8h"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"常见方剂有大补阴丸，黄柏知母熟地败龟板治阴亏火旺，肺痿咳血，呃逆烦热易饥，骨蒸盗汗，足膝疼热虚劳等症，能降阴火，益肾水，龟鹿二仙膏，败龟板鹿角枸杞人参，主大补精髓，益气养神，治视物不清，加味芎归汤，治横生倒产，交骨不开。用以催生良。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122113251-1dwqfe2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122113251-1dwqfe2"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【龟肉】味甘酸，性温，无毒。主筋骨疼痛，年久寒嗽，泻血血痢，酿酒治大风缓急，四肢拘挛，瘫缓不收，煮食治疗身肿痿折。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122113252-pmqhi61","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122113252-pmqhi61"}},{"ID":"20240122113259-jouxh6a","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122113259-jouxh6a","updated":"20240130143955"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"第一百二十五，龟甲。龟甲就是乌龟的甲壳。这个龟甲呢，味道是咸平，它是破症瘕疟痎，所以，有肿瘤有硬块，癌症，我们常常使用到咸味的药，龟甲的性呢，因为乌龟是沉潜的嘛，沉潜，扎到土里面，躲在里面，那乌龟它本身呢，它潜阳的力量很强，而且它味道是咸味，它攻坚，咸能够攻坚。"}]},{"ID":"20240122113308-rg1brvg","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122113308-rg1brvg","updated":"20240130144034"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"有一种病，小孩子呢，这个头顶的骨头……软骨，密合的不好，一个洞子在里面，没有密合，用龟甲效果最好，一下子就合起来了。最明显。那龟板呢，当乌龟肉……我们中国人什么都吃嘛，特别是广东人，乌龟肉怎么吃他们最清楚，那我们中医是用龟板。你平常写龟板，或者败龟板都没有关系。"}]},{"ID":"20240122113315-81qcynl","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122113315-81qcynl","updated":"20240130144145"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"滋阴益血，除了滋补以外，它同时有攻坚的效果。滋补以外又有攻坚的效果，所以很好用。那这个药呢，平常我们炙过，就是用火烧过，烤过以后再用。不烤过以后，腥味很重，所以火烤过一下，洗干净用火烤一下，烤一下然后切片，比较脆嘛，比较好切片。这是补血滋阴的，补肾。如果说是肾亏，我们也可以用龟甲来补，龟甲所以很好用。"}]},{"ID":"20240122113320-5hc44ln","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122113320-5hc44ln","updated":"20240130144307"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"所以唐容川就写了，它的本性，所以药的药性就是从这边来的，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"龟性伏，其精……精华在板，通任脉"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，诸位看那个乌龟，乌龟壳在这边……，乌龟的头伸出来的时候，你看嘴巴，如果这样，仔细看看嘴巴哦，它的舌头，永远是顶在上面，舌头，乌龟的舌头顶在上腭，它天生如此，所以它天生任督二脉是通的，所以乌龟很长寿。诸位比我好，诸位这两天舌头顶在上面听我讲，我是不断的耗元气。所以诸位平常没事，就算你开车回哪里去哪里，平常坐飞机，随时舌头顶在上腭，一直是顶在上腭，把它养成习惯，养成习惯以后，你常常训练气沉丹田，因为随时你行走坐卧，你无时无刻不在练功。这个大补，滋补，我们有那个大补阴丸，黄柏知母熟地败龟板，这个是南派的药，他们用的大补阴丸。那乌龟的肉呢，也可以吃。"}]}]}